LicenseID: LicenseRef-west-ncs-sbom-newlib-runtime
LicenseName: newlib runtime archives bundled license notice
ExtractedText: <text>The newlib runtime archives are built from a collection of source files
that carry multiple licenses and notices.

The upstream COPYING.NEWLIB notice states:
"The newlib subdirectory is a collection of software from several sources.
Each file may have its own copyright/license that is embedded in the source
file."

For Zephyr SDK toolchains that bundle newlib, the applicable notice files
are:
- share/licenses/newlib/COPYING
- share/licenses/newlib/COPYING.LIB
- share/licenses/newlib/COPYING.LIBGLOSS
- share/licenses/newlib/COPYING.NEWLIB
- share/licenses/newlib/COPYING3
- share/licenses/newlib/COPYING3.LIB

This LicenseRef represents that bundled multi-license notice set for the
toolchain runtime archives libc.a and libm.a.
</text>
